# The committed vault index is byte-compared against fresh rebuilds
# (brain validate --check-index); never let checkout newline conversion
# touch it (spec.md §8.2).
#
# merge=regenerate (spec.md §8.2): both committed generated files use a
# custom merge driver that keeps "ours" and relies on regeneration for
# correctness — never hand-merge generated content. Install once per clone:
#
#   git config merge.regenerate.driver true
#
# ("true" exits 0 leaving %A = ours.) Clones without the driver configured
# degrade to a normal conflict; see
# 10_Agents/solutions/vault-tooling/index-merge-conflicts.md for the
# fallback recipe.
10_Agents/tools/brain/vault-index.json -text merge=regenerate
.vscode/second-brain.code-snippets merge=regenerate
